# CroweTrade live-trading environment. TEMPLATE ONLY — no real values here.
#
# The real values are Cloudflare Worker SECRETS, set with `wrangler secret put`,
# never committed and never written to a dotfile. A private key in a file that
# something sources is a key you have already leaked; this project learned that
# lesson the expensive way with .env.secrets.
#
# BOTH must be present for the live path to arm. Either one missing leaves it
# structurally inert, and LIVE_TRADING must be the exact string "1" — "true",
# "yes" and " 1" are all deliberately refused.

# The dust wallet's keypair JSON, as a single line: [1,2,...,64]
#   npx wrangler secret put TRADING_KEYPAIR
TRADING_KEYPAIR=

# The arm. DO NOT SET until the live EXIT path and reconciliation exist:
# arming entries alone means the engine can buy and cannot sell.
#   npx wrangler secret put LIVE_TRADING
LIVE_TRADING=
